            <ArticleTitle>Lymph node stromal and vascular proliferations.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0740-2570(17)30130-2</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1053/j.semdp.2017.11.004</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The recognition and reporting of stromal and vascular lesions of the lymph node is rife with difficulties including relative rarity, a lack of familiarity with lesions and the challenges of using ancillary studies appropriately. In this manuscript, we highlight a range of benign stromal and vascular abnormalities that can be identified in nodal specimens.</AbstractText>
